    "description": "<p>Great Solar healers can draw the poison from even unnatural wounds. This Charm enhances a dramatic action to treat, monitor and tend to the patient. This action requires one hour without a stunt or a Charm. This Charm replaces the normal benefits of medical care. Instead, the Solar's player rolls (Intelligence + Medicine). If she succeeds, the Solar converts the target's aggravated wound levels to lethal wound levels.</p>",
